{"sha": "d28bc6c4936de39bd78fb1d9de71c16140e1ec1d7ca71527711efe5a69dec238", "body": ["{\\small 在数轴上计算 $8 + 5$：先跳到 $10$，再跳剩下的。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[相同数相加]\\label{ex:g1:addition:doubles}", "这些相同数相加的结果值得熟记：", "\\[", "1+1=2, \\quad 2+2=4, \\quad 3+3=6, \\quad 4+4=8, \\quad 5+5=10,", "\\]", "\\[", "6+6=12, \\quad 7+7=14, \\quad 8+8=16, \\quad 9+9=18, \\quad 10+10=20 .", "\\]", "相近的两数相加也很容易：$6 + 7$ 比 $6 + 6$ 多一，所以是 $13$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{小问题}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g1:addition:problem}", "“莉娅有 $7$ 张贴纸。她又得到 $6$ 张。现在有多少张？”", "得到更多就用加法：$7 + 6 = 13$（凑十法：", "$7 + 3 = 10$，再加 $+3$）。莉娅有 $13$ 张贴纸。最后一定要", "写一句话作答！", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:addition:1}", "画出弹珠并计算：$4 + 3$；\\quad $5 + 2$；\\quad", "$6 + 4$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:addition:2}", "从较大的数开始算：$3 + 8$；\\quad", "$2 + 12$；\\quad $4 + 9$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:addition:3}", "说出与下列各数凑成十的数：$7$；\\ $4$；\\ $9$；\\ $5$；\\ $1$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:addition:4}", "用凑十法计算（见\\cref{met:g1:addition:crossten}）：", "$9 + 4$；\\quad $8 + 7$；\\quad $6 + 5$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:addition:5}", "先背一背相同数相加，再用来计算：$7 + 8$；\\quad", "$5 + 6$；\\quad $9 + 8$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:addition:6}", "填空：", "\\[", "6 + \\;?\\; = 10, \\qquad", "\\;?\\; + 5 = 12, \\qquad", "10 + \\;?\\; = 17 .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:addition:7}", "“车上有 $8$ 个小朋友；$5$ 位大人上车。车上", "一共有多少人？”写出加法算式和", "答句。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:addition:8}", "汤姆有 $6$ 辆红色小车和 $7$ 辆蓝色小车。米娅有 $10$ 辆车。谁", "拥有的车更多？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g1:addition:9}", "三个骰子分别显示 $4$、$6$ 和 $5$。它们的和是多少？（先把两个骰子", "的点数相加——选出能凑成十的那两个！）", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}